ow and we'll arrange a switch to a different tutor at no extra cost. We want every student to feel comfortable and confident with their tutor."},{question:"Can I reschedule or cancel sessions?",answer:"Yes, we understand life happens. You can reschedule or cancel sessions with 24 hours' notice at no charge. Sessions cancelled with less notice may be subject to our cancellation policy."},{question:"How quickly will I see results?",answer:"Most students show measurable improvement within 4-6 weeks. However, every child learns differently. Our tutors track progress carefully and adjust their approach to ensure continuous improvement. Significant grade improvements typically occur within 3-6 months."},{question:"Do you help with homework and exam preparation?",answer:"Absolutely! Our tutors can help with regular homework support, revision for upcoming tests, and comprehensive exam preparation including GCSE and A-Level. We provide practice papers, marking, and targeted feedback. Students can send homework and questions into their WhatsApp group, and tutors provide guidance, feedback, and exam tips — even outside lesson time. We believe learning should not stop when the session ends."},{question:"What technology do we need?",answer:"Just a computer, laptop, or tablet with a webcam and stable internet connection. Our platform works in any modern web browser—no special software to download. We'll guide you through the simple setup process."},{question:"Is there a free trial?",answer:"Yes! Every new student receives a free 30-minute trial session with no obligation. This helps you experience our tutoring approach and find the right tutor for your child before committing to a plan."}];function vD(){const e=Hn(),t=e?{}:{initial:{opacity:0,y:20},whileInView:{opacity:1,y:0},viewport:{once:!0},transition:{duration:.5}},n=e?{}:{initial:{opacity:0,y:20},whileInView:{opacity:1,y:0},viewport:{once:!0},transition:{delay:.2}};return f.jsx("section",{id:"faq",className:"py-24 px-4 bg-g